---
description: After changing SCALY Cleaner app code, auto-push to GitHub for user updates
globs:
  - scalyclean/**
  - main.py
  - assets/**
  - ScalyCleaner.spec
  - tools/build_release.py
  - .github/workflows/**
alwaysApply: false
---

When you finish editing files that affect the released app (under globs above), run once before ending your turn:

`python tools/auto_deploy.py`

from the project root `C:\Documents\cleanerforSCALY`. Do not ask the user to run git manually. If push fails (auth/network), report the error briefly.

Do not auto-deploy for question-only replies or docs-only edits outside release paths.
